  "summary": "用 Taskfile 统一运行项目中的构建和日常命令。",
  "icon": {
    "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/go-task/task/b5aef1c287a9be8038347a17646bdf4bc7185bce/website/src/public/img/logo.svg",
    "sha256": "31bbfbd9df5d3c426b567ee3fc71f3a345dd8d6716a3220cdc5a18447acb3008",
    "mime": "image/svg+xml",
